{
  "summary": "RQ-containing sums lead, with MA1+RQ best but SE+RQ and RQ+PER close. Quadratic means improve both tested singleton kernels; their value within the leading sum remains unresolved. Simple LIN modulation did not help, but modulation within additive models is untested. Next compare companion smoothness and mean while holding MA1+RQ structure fixed where possible, then explore component-specific amplitude and periodic modulation.",
